  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801146,
    "RowId": 42000,
    "Text": "To take it outside, the Brute Abombinator means business!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801214,
    "RowId": 42001,
    "Text": "Will the unenhanced warrior be able to contend with this chimerical foe!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801298,
    "RowId": 42002,
    "Text": "My word! He's used his feral powers to manifest a weapon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801366,
    "RowId": 42003,
    "Text": "Oh dear, fiendish flora have sprouted from the scattered seeds!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801442,
    "RowId": 42004,
    "Text": "Oh my! Even the cameras have been petrified─and now they're crashing down all around!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801542,
    "RowId": 42005,
    "Text": "He's sent his rival flying! What fearsome strength!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801606,
    "RowId": 42006,
    "Text": "Goodness me! The Brute Abombinator is hanging on the building!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801682,
    "RowId": 42007,
    "Text": "He's bounding from wall to wall!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801726,
    "RowId": 42008,
    "Text": "The rooftop has caved in! Such devastation!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801782,
    "RowId": 42009,
    "Text": "We'll send cameras in there at once!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801830,
    "RowId": 42010,
    "Text": "The destruction appears to have started a fire!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801890,
    "RowId": 42011,
    "Text": "A lariat! The Brute Bomber must still be in there somewhere!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 801962,
    "RowId": 42012,
    "Text": "A punishing attack! The true power of this monstrous fusion!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 802034,
    "RowId": 42013,
    "Text": "The contender dodged everything! Why am I not surprised!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 802102,
    "RowId": 42014,
    "Text": "A brutal blow! But the contender is standing firm!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 802166,
    "RowId": 42015,
    "Text": "What a thrilling battle this, and it rages on!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 802226,
    "RowId": 42016,
    "Text": "Defeat the Brute Abombinator"
  },
  {
